[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18247.11, "timestamp": "05:04:07", "text": "どれくらいですか？2:30。わかりました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18251.59, "timestamp": "05:04:11", "text": "まとめるのにいい時間です。はい、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18253.99, "timestamp": "05:04:13", "text": "まとめるときに少しだけやります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18259.43, "timestamp": "05:04:19", "text": "それで、ええ、このゲームはとてもクールで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18262.39, "timestamp": "05:04:22", "text": "楽しかったです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18264.948, "timestamp": "05:04:24", "text": "ピューピュー。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18268.55, "timestamp": "05:04:28", "text": "レベル10くらいになったかな。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18272.07, "timestamp": "05:04:32", "text": "たくさんおしっこした。Hにいた。Jaにいた。オーケー。いいね。いいね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18279.19, "timestamp": "05:04:39", "text": "それは驚きだ。えっと、オーケー。待って、待って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18280.55, "timestamp": "05:04:40", "text": "待って。何？何をしたの？何をしたの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18282.628, "timestamp": "05:04:42", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18285.67, "timestamp": "05:04:45", "text": "オーケー、これ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18287.91, "timestamp": "05:04:47", "text": "クランがあるんだ。これすらやらないと思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18291.19, "timestamp": "05:04:51", "text": "。クランを作るのはもう終わり。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18297.27, "timestamp": "05:04:57", "text": "この"}]